            <gmd:abstract>
                <gco:CharacterString>TIEGCM v3.0.1

             

This release accompanies the JGR: Space Physics paper "The NCAR-TIEGCM Version 3.0" — DOI: 10.1029/2025JA034219. Please cite both the paper and this software DOI when using the model.

Documentation

                                                                                 

- Read the Docs: https://tiegcm-docs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/



Post-processing (gcmprocpy): https://gcmprocpy.readthedocs.io/en/latest/


What's Changed



Citations by @AnonNick in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/50

Include parallel velocity in the output by @hzfywhn in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/53

Added NASA Electra node support by @AnonNick in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/51

Atiken update + year boundary fix by @AnonNick in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/55

last segment PRISTOP day fix by @AnonNick in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/57

Change output names by @hzfywhn in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/59

Update README with data files and tool changes by @AnonNick in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/62

Development to master by @AnonNick in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/60

Add SECFLDS by @AnonNick in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/63

Citation by @AnonNick in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/64

Development by @AnonNick in https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/pull/65


Full Changelog: https://github.com/NCAR/tiegcm/compare/MAGE_1.0.5...TIEGCM-3.0.1</gco:CharacterString>
